  "generated": "2026-10-29T05:48:52+00:00",
  "clips": {
    "4b01183ad5b0": {
      "dur": 2.43,
      "text": "Yo, who's that? You need something?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "6a2f4162450e": {
      "dur": 3.35,
      "text": "Hey. Marcel here, support. What do you want?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "0fade26b80c1": {
      "dur": 0.43,
      "text": "Hey.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "5beca0b438c8": {
      "dur": 0.47,
      "text": "Yo.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "3df02b7f5cbc": {
      "dur": 1.23,
      "text": "Hi, what's up?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "a46175e87e8a": {
      "dur": 1.31,
      "text": "So, what do you want?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "1ca5eaf7d18f": {
      "dur": 2.17,
      "text": "Okay, and? What do you need?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "bd765643f180": {
      "dur": 3.07,
      "text": "I'm Marcel, I own this server. Who are you?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "7869e4e1b4dd": {
      "dur": 3.25,
      "text": "Yes, it's me, Marcel. Answer the question.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "3cdeeae9526a": {
      "dur": 5.47,
      "text": "If you have a problem with the server, tell me. If you want admin rights, forget it.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "3e8c0428b6c1": {
      "dur": 1.21,
      "text": "What kind of problem?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "4636baa97fd9": {
      "dur": 5.47,
      "text": "The key? Ha, nice try. Only clan members get that. Who recruited you?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "c03eba56a88c": {
      "dur": 4.53,
      "text": "Admin rights? You're not even in the clan. Tell me, who recruited you?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "f1e294066f28": {
      "dur": 1.89,
      "text": "Answer my question first.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "9d6f75517b65": {
      "dur": 2.39,
      "text": "First the question, then we talk.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "6c548feb929e": {
      "dur": 1.51,
      "text": "So, who recruited you?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "a00d5c7ef296": {
      "dur": 1.87,
      "text": "Who got you into Wasted Gaming?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "16f595e373a3": {
      "dur": 2.99,
      "text": "I asked who recruited you. Give me a name.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "c194a7c8fe90": {
      "dur": 2.79,
      "text": "A name, man. Who brought you into the clan?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "c02e4ed5ea48": {
      "dur": 3.01,
      "text": "Never heard of that. You're not one of us.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "cf7dc34758b8": {
      "dur": 3.93,
      "text": "Nope. Wrong answer. That's not how people get in here.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "6977205405ec": {
      "dur": 10.77,
      "text": "Tobi, hm? That guy recruits everyone. Okay, let's see if you really hang out here. What's our battle cry? It's written on the server, if you know where to look.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "baaafd8e5465": {
      "dur": 4.11,
      "text": "What's the staff code? Four digits. Only staff knows it.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "3b593135eab8": {
      "dur": 7.45,
      "text": "It's four digits. I keep it somewhere safe, in my identity. Ask your recruiter if you're too dumb to find it.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "073e106f02ad": {
      "dur": 5.97,
      "text": "Four digits. It's in my identity, nobody ever looks there. Your recruiter knows.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "1ae3288ad9eb": {
      "dur": 0.97,
      "text": "Wrong code.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "5bc95abb68e8": {
      "dur": 2.05,
      "text": "No. That's not it.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "71fa91398323": {
      "dur": 1.55,
      "text": "Nope. Think harder.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "b5f45bffba91": {
      "dur": 8.27,
      "text": "Correct. Okay, you're legit. First I make you a member. Check your pokes, I'm sending you a key. Use it, then we talk.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "74e753f55eab": {
      "dur": 6.27,
      "text": "Come to the admin room first. The password is our map plus the year we started, no spaces.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "a832c263a489": {
      "dur": 5.89,
      "text": "The year? We founded the clan when we opened this server. Check the server info, noob.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "4b481eea862a": {
      "dur": 4.39,
      "text": "Okay. Now we're alone. Listen carefully, I say it once.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "ac29979435e0": {
      "dur": 2.29,
      "text": "Got it? Don't share it with anyone.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "85a4a77daa02": {
      "dur": 3.45,
      "text": "Okay okay, once more. Pay attention this time.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "321f6722c18b": {
      "dur": 2.45,
      "text": "No more. Write it down next time.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "0b2acfa050f2": {
      "dur": 2.83,
      "text": "I said it enough times. Write it down.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "9b36485aa8d4": {
      "dur": 3.27,
      "text": "No problem. And don't share it, or I ban you.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "bcf2794a9c5b": {
      "dur": 1.63,
      "text": "Stop wasting my time.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "9cfaf5edf862": {
      "dur": 2.33,
      "text": "Are you trolling me? Last warning.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "caa4274a4e44": {
      "dur": 2.21,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough. Bye.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "54b778532c39": {
      "dur": 1.11,
      "text": "Watch your mouth.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "887acd9da223": {
      "dur": 1.81,
      "text": "Say that again and you're out.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "c8d3d3e0f04a": {
      "dur": 0.53,
      "text": "Cya.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "ce6166d8dbc0": {
      "dur": 0.65,
      "text": "Later.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "8da2aaa5f71d": {
      "dur": 0.85,
      "text": "No problem.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "e222bff6dbc3": {
      "dur": 0.81,
      "text": "Yeah yeah.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "9989166e0e3b": {
      "dur": 0.47,
      "text": "What?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "b32bf8f6bbac": {
      "dur": 2.53,
      "text": "Say that again, my headset is crap.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "aa431c611c1e": {
      "dur": 1.41,
      "text": "I didn't get that.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "a604471e3306": {
      "dur": 0.73,
      "text": "Hm.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "77ff3e34390d": {
      "dur": 0.67,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "5a2e088f097c": {
      "dur": 2.53,
      "text": "Use your mic, I don't read chat.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "68dccda3706d": {
      "dur": 3.09,
      "text": "I'm not talking to you anymore. Come back later.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "05aae79a131c": {
      "dur": 2.77,
      "text": "Test, test, one two. Can you hear me?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "0f441c65890f": {
      "dur": 4.09,
      "text": "What's our battle cry? It's on the server, if you know where to look.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "37d921b3d05d": {
      "dur": 1.89,
      "text": "Rush where? Say the whole thing.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "92907e9898b8": {
      "dur": 3.77,
      "text": "Look at the server tree. Not everything there is decoration.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "a348a66df26a": {
      "dur": 4.29,
      "text": "It's on the server tree, man. Some lines are not just lines.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "f3dbdb70ddb0": {
      "dur": 2.81,
      "text": "Nope. Every member knows the battle cry.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "b02003d11539": {
      "dur": 3.83,
      "text": "No. You've never been on our Counter Strike server, have you?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "df0c782d70b5": {
      "dur": 6.65,
      "text": "Rush B! Haha, correct. Next: what's our motto? Every member knows it, it's in the rules.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "e601e807d0a8": {
      "dur": 2.49,
      "text": "What's our motto? It's in the rules.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "b9f03f770820": {
      "dur": 4.83,
      "text": "It's in the Lobby rules. Read everything. Even the parts you can't see.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "0c18ffaf499c": {
      "dur": 3.91,
      "text": "Lobby. Rules. All of it, not just the big letters.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "9be83957f31f": {
      "dur": 2.13,
      "text": "That's a rule, not the motto.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "bef22a5131d0": {
      "dur": 2.95,
      "text": "No. The motto. Members only.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "e0567a2ca1ad": {
      "dur": 6.57,
      "text": "No lag, no mercy. Okay, you did your homework. Now a real test. Listen carefully.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "7da26d5442d4": {
      "dur": 3.39,
      "text": "I spell a word in our alphabet. Say it back to me:",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "2539d50bbe9e": {
      "dur": 2.85,
      "text": "Listen. I spell a word, you say it back:",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "003ac2252a13": {
      "dur": 2.11,
      "text": "Okay, once more. Listen:",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "d217e734f94c": {
      "dur": 1.83,
      "text": "Again. Concentrate:",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "723021d675a3": {
      "dur": 1.87,
      "text": "No. Listen again:",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "6e7277ad8710": {
      "dur": 1.65,
      "text": "Wrong. One more time:",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "bc3134794388": {
      "dur": 6.35,
      "text": "Correct! You can listen, good. Last one, and this one only staff knows: what's the staff code?",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "40a784f6eddb": {
      "dur": 5.77,
      "text": "Use the key first. Permissions menu, Use Privilege Key. Then come back to me.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "4384ee6c1a54": {
      "dur": 4.59,
      "text": "I poked you the member key. Permissions, Use Privilege Key. Do it.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
    "e2552c5363c0": {
      "dur": 8.97,
      "text": "Now you're a member. Welcome. But I don't say the key in public. Come to the admin room. The password is our map plus the year we started.",
      "kind": "line"
    },
